Activity_summer_drop_rules:
1. During the event commanders will have a certain chance to find a Summer gift box while collecting resources in and outside the city or after defeating an army of the invaders. The Summer gift box will be sent to you by email; 
 2. Open the Summer gift box to get branches; 
 3. The branches can be used in the Summer Night event.

Activity_Suskin2024_Exchange_Desc:
1. Earn "Ingot" and "Firecracker" by participating in the New Year Missions event;
2. During the event, open "Fortune Chests" to choose between "Ingot" and "Firecracker". "Fortune Chests" can be obtained through the New Year Treasure event and the New Year Treasure Pack;
3. Use "Ingot" and "Firecracker" to exchange for valuable rewards in the Jester's Store!

Activity_Valentine2024_Exchange_Desc:
1. 3-day event: Collect resources inside your base, gather resources outside, and attack Invaders to get the event item "Love Box".
2. Gift the "Love Box" to a friend, and you will receive "Roses," which can be exchanged for a corresponding Avatar Frame in the Love Exchange;
3. When you receive the gift "Cupid" from a friend, you can exchange it for a Chat Frame;
4. Follow the official FB: Dead Empire: Zombie War, participate in Community events, and instantly get event items.

Activity_anniversary5_rule:
Five-Year Anniversary Series Events: 
1. Discount event for special mall gift packs has started; 
2. Supreme Castle Decoration is available for a limited time in the War Zone Market; 
3. Puzzle Treasure Hunt event has started, join now to win generous prizes!

Activity_anniversary6_rule:
Thank you for being with us, Commander! Here are the arrangements for the 6th Anniversary Event:
1. Mall discount event Start! Tons of deals, the event lasts until the end of the month, and discount cards can be stacked;
2. Supreme Base Decoration returns for a limited time;
3. New items in the Friends Mall—send and receive gifts with friends! Players who send gifts can get Rose Coin rebates, which can be used to exchange for Items in the Rose Mall;
4. Themed events are coming soon, with new Decorate Items on the way—stay tuned.

Activity_new_monster_rule_2026:
Humans have been fighting against the Pandora troops for six years, and suddenly, parade Floats have appeared.
1. Attacking Floats can drop rewards;
2. After the celebration begins, attacking Floats can drop event Item, with a daily limit of 30 per day.

LC_ALLIANCE_GuildMB_info2:
1. Troops can be sent to Maneuvers Base to obtain lots of rewards; 
2. Maneuvers Base can't be attacked. 
3. The more members that participate in constructing the Maneuvers Base, the faster the construction speed will be.

LC_COMMON_officer_store_desc:
1. Use Black Gold Chips obtained from certain events to exchange for Officer Badges;
2. The exchange chances for goods in the Officer Store will reset weekly;
3. The goods in the Officer Store will be updated periodically.

