LC_OTHER_super_shootgame_information:
1. Tap anywhere at the shooting Ground, and shoot down targets to get reward;
2. For every 10 targets you shoot down, a big reward will be given;
3. Training here will consume you Diamonds or Super Simulator Chips;
4. Diamonds, Chips, and Coins you earned can be consumed directly, while other items will enter your supply automatically.

LC_OTHER_FPS_SS_Information:
1. With a Lv6 or above Radar, your max bomb load of missiles will be 2;
With a Lv12 or above Radar, your max load of missiles will be 3;
2. With a Lv8 or above Radar, Level 2 will be unlocked;
3. Each level has its respective daily rankings;
4. More levels are under development. Please stay tuned.

LC_POPBOX_Medal_collect_D:
How to obtain medals: 
1. Purchase Medal Boxes in the store;
2. Participate in specific game events/activities;
3. Participate in the Shooting Ground.

LC_POPBOX_GuildRC_rule_info2:
1. Guild members can donate resources to get Research points and Black Market coins, Research points will be directly added to the Guild Research;
2. When a Guild's research points are full, the Guild leader can start the said research;
3. The boosts from Guild Research will have effect on all Guild members.
4. Lv6 H.Q is required for a guild member to be able to donate at the Guild Research Center.
5. The max number of donators each day is 100.
